1
00:00:00,884 --> 00:00:04,594
CHRISTY: I'm just saying you can take the
damn plastic off the couch once in a while.

2
00:00:04,763 --> 00:00:06,893
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Why, so you
and Howard can hump on it?

3
00:00:08,767 --> 00:00:11,057
HOWARD: Ladies, ladies,
I'm sure there's a middle ground.

4
00:00:11,228 --> 00:00:13,478
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Shut up, Howard!
CHRISTY: Shut up, Howard!

5
00:00:14,231 --> 00:00:16,901
HOWARD: You guys talk.
I'm gonna take my scooter out for a spin.

6
00:00:17,067 --> 00:00:19,317
CHRISTY: You happy?
You drove your son out of the house.

7
00:00:19,486 --> 00:00:21,236
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Why don't you stop butting in?

8
00:00:21,405 --> 00:00:24,405
- What are you guys doing here?
- It's "Halo" night.

9
00:00:24,575 --> 00:00:26,405
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
He's not a man, he's a putz.

10
00:00:26,577 --> 00:00:28,827
(Howard's Mother(voice):)And don't you take that tone with me,
you gold digger.

11
00:00:28,996 --> 00:00:32,036
CHRISTY: What'd you call me?
MRS. WOLOWITZ: You heard me.

12
00:00:32,207 --> 00:00:33,747
(Howard's Mother(voice):)You're barking up the wrong tree...

13
00:00:33,917 --> 00:00:37,007
...because as long as you're around,
Howard is out of the will.

14
00:00:37,171 --> 00:00:40,421
CHRISTY: You know what?
I got better offers. I'm out of here.

15
00:00:40,591 --> 00:00:44,431
MRS. WOLOWITZ: That's right.
Go back to Babylon, you whore.

16
00:00:47,681 --> 00:00:49,851
So "Halo" night, huh?

17
00:00:51,768 --> 00:00:54,938
- I thought she was the whore of Omaha.
- Shh.

18
00:00:58,859 --> 00:01:00,689
[GUNFIRE ON TV]

